          <li><a href="/blog/web-scraping-javascript" class="text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">JavaScript Web Scraping</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/web-scraping-go" class="text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">Go Web Scraping</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/web-scraping-java" class="text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">Java Web Scraping</a></li>
